  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "层族构成(78 层)",
      "items": [
        "L0:dense SwiGLU FFN(intermediate 18432)+ full indexer",
        "L1–L77:MoE(256 路由 + 1 共享,top-8)+ 20 个 full indexer 层(含 L0 全模型共 21)",
        "其余 57 层为 shared indexer:复用最近前驱 full 层的 top-k 索引",
        "lm_head logits 以 FP32 累加(head_dtype),权重保持 BF16"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "iHC 四通道残差",
      "items": [
        "每个子块(attn / MLP)由 hc_pre 归约到单通道,输出经 hc_post 散回 4 通道",
        "hc_post 无参数:y = post·x + residual(幅度 2.0)",
        "78 层结束后 hc_head 合并 4 通道,再进 final norm"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "草稿与运行时状态",
      "items": [
        "MTP ×1:enorm/hnorm → eh_proj(12288→6144),块内无 iHC,共享 embed 与 lm_head",
        "MLA 压缩 KV cache 每 token 512+64 维(默认 BF16;量化部署时 fp8_ds_mla);indexer 另有恒为 FP8 的 key-only cache",
        "positions 与 attention metadata 由 vLLM runtime 提供,不经过权重"
      ]
    }
